    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6992" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναμέτρ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>measurement,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς γῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					1.1.20
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				918xi14
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν θείων περιόδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Myst.</u>
					9.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>estimate,</i>
			
